## Boiler room

::bg{location="boiler" time="night"}
@narrator: The lantern finds the stairs one at a time. At the bottom: the boiler, the size of a bus, and beside it the furnace door, a mouth with a latch.
@narrator: Three levers on a panel, numbered I, II, III in stencil. Behind the gauge glass, a needle twitches as if the thing were dreaming.
<match on="run.power">
  <when is="true">
    @narrator: The boiler breathes. Pipes tick all through the building like knuckles cracking.
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @nell{mono}: If this lights, the whole ward wakes. The lifts. The surgery doors. Everything.
  </otherwise>
</match>
